>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TEST-REPOSITORY.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "appointment-status.cpy".
COPY "appointment-config.cpy".
COPY "appointment-repository-request.cpy".
COPY "appointment-record.cpy".
01 FAILURES PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 SCAN-COUNT PIC 9 VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    INITIALIZE APPOINTMENT-CONFIG APPOINTMENT-RECORD APPOINTMENT-REPOSITORY-REQUEST
    MOVE "build/test-repository.db" TO AC-DATA-FILE
    MOVE "build/test-repository.safety.db" TO AC-SAFETY-FILE
    MOVE "FORCE-INIT" TO ARR-OPERATION PERFORM REPO
    IF ARR-STATUS-CODE NOT = APPT-OK ADD 1 TO FAILURES END-IF
    MOVE 3 TO AR-SCHEMA-VERSION MOVE "000000001" TO AR-ID
    MOVE 1 TO AR-REVISION MOVE "N" TO AR-RECURRENCE
    MOVE "A" TO AR-STATUS MOVE 20250101 TO AR-START-DATE AR-END-DATE
    MOVE "PUT" TO ARR-OPERATION PERFORM REPO
    MOVE "000000001" TO ARR-ID MOVE "GET" TO ARR-OPERATION INITIALIZE AR-CLIENT
    PERFORM REPO
    IF ARR-STATUS-CODE NOT = APPT-OK OR AR-ID NOT = "000000001" ADD 1 TO FAILURES END-IF
    MOVE "PUT" TO ARR-OPERATION PERFORM REPO
    IF ARR-STATUS-CODE NOT = APPT-DUPLICATE ADD 1 TO FAILURES END-IF
    MOVE "OPEN-SCAN" TO ARR-OPERATION PERFORM REPO
    MOVE "NEXT-SCAN" TO ARR-OPERATION PERFORM REPO
    IF ARR-STATUS-CODE = APPT-OK ADD 1 TO SCAN-COUNT END-IF
    MOVE "Scan update" TO AR-CLIENT
    MOVE "UPDATE" TO ARR-OPERATION PERFORM REPO
    IF ARR-STATUS-CODE NOT = APPT-OK ADD 1 TO FAILURES END-IF
    MOVE "NEXT-SCAN" TO ARR-OPERATION PERFORM REPO
    IF ARR-STATUS-CODE NOT = APPT-NOT-FOUND ADD 1 TO FAILURES END-IF
    MOVE "CLOSE-SCAN" TO ARR-OPERATION PERFORM REPO
    IF SCAN-COUNT NOT = 1 ADD 1 TO FAILURES END-IF
    MOVE "000000001" TO ARR-ID MOVE "DELETE" TO ARR-OPERATION PERFORM REPO
    MOVE "GET" TO ARR-OPERATION PERFORM REPO
    IF ARR-STATUS-CODE NOT = APPT-NOT-FOUND ADD 1 TO FAILURES END-IF
    MOVE "build/no-such-directory/repository.db" TO AC-DATA-FILE
    MOVE "ENSURE" TO ARR-OPERATION PERFORM REPO
    IF ARR-STATUS-CODE NOT = APPT-REPOSITORY-ERROR ADD 1 TO FAILURES END-IF
    DISPLAY "repository tests failures=" FAILURES
    MOVE FAILURES TO RETURN-CODE GOBACK.
REPO.
    CALL "APPOINTMENT-REPOSITORY" USING APPOINTMENT-REPOSITORY-REQUEST
      APPOINTMENT-RECORD APPOINTMENT-CONFIG.
END PROGRAM TEST-REPOSITORY.
